      "content": "Wait, you said it \"may not be the best option\" but then you mentioned the Robitussin right after. I'm just trying to figure out if it's actually dangerous or just not \"ideal.\" Like, can I take a dose of the dextro if I'm really struggling, or is there a specific reason it's a bad idea? I just need some sleep.",
